    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to this stunning 3-bedroom modern \"A\"-rated family home offering an impressive 130 sqm of bright, well-proportioned living space. Finished to an exceptional standard throughout, this beautiful property features, oak doors and oak laminated wood floors, double glazed PVC windows, an air to water central heating system, and a cosy log burning stove in the lounge.\r\n\r\nThe light-filled accommodation comprises a large open plan kitchen/dining/sitting room, a separate utility room, guest WC, family bathroom and two en-suite bathrooms. Integrated kitchen appliances are included in the sale, along with carpets, blinds and light fittings. An added bonus is the superb barn-style attic conversion, providing versatile additional space. Other features include an installed water filtration system and an EV car charger.\r\n\r\nThis charming property boasts an attractive low maintenance exterior finished in red brick and plaster dash, complemented by a spacious double cobble lock driveway providing ample off-street parking. To the rear, a large south-facing garden offers a wonderful sense of space and light, with its low maintenance design allowing you to spend more time enjoying the outdoors. A covered patio area, perfect for alfresco dining and entertaining, is seamlessly accessed through elegant floor to ceiling sliding patio doors, creating a beautiful flow between indoor and outdoor living. Adding to the practicality of the home is a convenient pedestrian side entrance.\r\n\r\nIdeally located just a 15 to 20 minute walk from Donabate train station and the beautiful Newbridge Park, and only 10 minutes' drive from Dublin Airport with easy access to the M1 and M50, this is an ideal family home combining modern comfort, energy efficiency and superb convenience."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall: 16' 9\" * 3' 2\"\r\nOak laminated wood floor, radiator cover, under stairs storage unit. \r\n\r\nGuest toilet: 4' 2\" * 4' 1\" \r\nWC,WHB, tiled floor, extractor fan.\r\n\r\nLounge: 13' 5\" * 12' 1\" \r\nFeature log burning stove, Oak laminated wood floor, bay window, TV point. \r\n\r\nKitchen/dining/sitting room area: 16' 4\" * 16' 4\" \r\nWall and floor mounted units with a breakfast bar, Integrated appliances, sink, water filtration system, Oak laminated wood floor, Sliding patio doors leading out to the South facing garden. TV point. \r\n\r\nUtility room: 4' 6\" * 4' 5\" \r\nPlumbed for a washing machine and dryer\r\n\r\nUPSTAIRS\r\n\r\nLanding: Hot press, window\r\n\r\nBedroom one: 13' 1\" * 9' 3\" \r\nFitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nEn-suite: 6' * 5' 9\" \r\nWC,WHB, Corner shower unit, window\r\n\r\nBedroom two: 15' 6\" * 8' 8\" \r\nFitted wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom three: 12' 5\" * 6' 5\" \r\nFitted wardrobe\r\n\r\nBathroom: 8' 3\" * 5' 2\" \r\n\r\nAttic room: 14' 2\" * 12' 4\" \r\n2 Velux windows, eves storage, TV point\r\n\r\nEn-suite: 7' 9\" * 3' 3\" \r\nWC, WHB, Corner shower unit, Velux window\r\n\r\nOUTSIDE \r\n\r\nRear: South facing low maintenance garden with a cover patio area, side entrance, shed\r\n\r\nFront: Double cobble lock driveway, EV charge cable, side entrance."
      },
